WEBVTT

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.880
Morning!

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:07.860
Good morning.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:16.370
It's definitely not unenjoyable.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.870
However, I thought that each of them were hiding...

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:22.750
...their unspeakable bitterness behind their smiles.

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:24.070
Don't you find it surprising?

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:25.940
It surprised me.

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:22.120
Why don't you put down your legs?

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:25.120
Yeah, thank you very much.

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:37.590
Um, they are tearing and eating their colleague's internal organs.

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:39.180
Well, that's because...

00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:41.890
...they're zombies, and it's in their nature to attack and eat humans.

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:42.640
Eat?

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:44.720
This is unexpected.

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:46.810
She said she'd never watched any zombie movies before,

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:49.140
so I brought some hardcore movies.

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:50.560
She's watching them so intently.

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:51.550
Amazing!

00:02:51.550 --> 00:02:53.900
So much is coming out!

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:56.900
Since she's a lady, she's quite stubborn!

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:59.650
Well, I'd like your help soon.

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:01.860
Ah, I am so sorry.

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:03.120
I got too absorbed in the movie...

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:06.040
Can you rip these off as well?

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:06.870
Sure.

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:13.330
So what kind of poisonous herbs are you going to try today?

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:16.170
Well, I'm running out of ideas.

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:18.510
Eh?

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:20.300
Even if I follow the manuscript,

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:24.100
whether it can bring the dead back to life is still uncertain.

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:26.060
What's more, there's a part that's unreadable.

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:30.980
So, what will happen to Babu-chan?

00:03:32.310 --> 00:03:34.150
Well, I guess I should bury him.

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:35.650
Eh?

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:37.230
Five days have already passed.

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:40.740
Or how about... you eat him?

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:42.150
No!

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:44.990
How can you think of something like that?!

00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:47.830
To eat Babu-chan... No way!

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:50.120
She really can't take any jokes.

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:52.790
But having said that,

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:56.880
I've tried most of the poisonous herbs that I can get.

00:03:57.420 --> 00:04:01.630
Morning glory, lily of the valley, hemlock, plum...

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:03.130
...and what else?

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:08.060
Please wait for a moment.

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:09.680
I will go get it right now.

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:15.190
Hey, what are you going to get?

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:28.780
She is unexpectedly aggressive.

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:36.460
My father's love for me is beyond normally accepted levels.

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:42.550
Rea-ojousama, Rabbit-san wants to play with you this time.

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:50.180
Ojou-sama, this way. Come...

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:55.190
Ojou-sama.

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:58.980
It's fine. Don't cry.

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:01.070
Ojou-sama, you're strong.

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:05.950
Before anyone knew it, that maid was fired.

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:28.390
The cat never showed up again, and the maids also disappeared.

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:36.140
And in the end, only my cold mother, Aria, was left for me.

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:43.780
Rea, let's take pictures of you this year as well.

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:48.740
Now open your eyes and smile.

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:08.840
Now that I am growing up,

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:12.220
I have come to understand that this is not normal.

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:22.150
It seems that my mother knew about my father's abnormal feelings towards me.

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:34.120
I feel like running away.

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:42.750
I constantly feel the presence of my father and his subordinates.

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:47.510
They monitor me all the time, no matter where I go.

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:53.970
Rea, good morning!

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:55.720
What happened?

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:57.200
You look down.

00:06:58.230 --> 00:06:59.730
Nothing is wrong.

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:01.770
Good morning.

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:09.780
She is the first person whom I could call a friend.

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:14.620
Since her family is also of high social class,

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:16.540
my father has approved of our friendship.

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:26.050
I thought that behind their smiles,

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:29.760
each of them was hiding their unspeakable bitterness.

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:32.680
However, from associating with her...

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:35.010
...I realised that wasn't the case at all.

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:38.140
I am the only unfortunate one.

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:47.270
Is that really true?

00:07:47.270 --> 00:07:48.940
Yeah.

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:52.030
It's the first time I've told anyone about this.

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:54.530
That's strange...

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:57.580
Taking pictures of your daughter in the nude...

00:07:58.370 --> 00:07:59.580
I guess.

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:04.580
You should ask your father to stop.

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:05.830
Yes...

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:07.290
But...

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:11.260
I too fight with my dad all the time.

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:12.510
Even if it'll be a huge argument,

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:14.430
you should make him stop, no matter what!

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:18.060
Is it really okay to argue with him?

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:20.560
It'll be fine since you are father and daughter.

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:29.860
I have deeply regretted confessing to her on that day.

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:41.830
She's slow.

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:44.920
Did she get lost in the mountains?

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:47.880
Or maybe she slipped, and fell into the river.

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:56.180
I guess there's no way she would do something so dangerous.

00:08:58.140 --> 00:09:00.600
What is she thinking, climbing up a place like that?

00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:11.110
Furuya-kun!

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:14.120
Gosh!

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:16.570
I guess a lady needs a bodyguard all the time.

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:18.380
H-How rude!

00:09:18.380 --> 00:09:20.120
I can climb this slope by myself.

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:22.290
In that case, should I let go?

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:23.870
Wait a minute!

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:34.340
So... what made you do something like that?

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:36.720
I-It was...

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:41.140
As I was searching for it, I saw one blooming right below the grave.

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:44.680
I thought it'd be much faster and closer to climb up and pick that one.

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:47.100
Even though you're a lady, you sure are reckless.

00:09:48.810 --> 00:09:49.610
It is fine.

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:54.780
Even if I die, Furuya-kun will bring me back to life as a zombie.

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:56.110
Hey, hey...

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:59.200
I haven't been successful in reviving Babu.

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:03.120
Even if it works, have I ever said I would bring you back to life?

00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:06.120
If so, I will say it now...

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:07.870
Huh?

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:12.380
Please... bring me back to life.

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:23.140
What is it?

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:24.520
I do not want this anymore.

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:28.020
Could you please stop doing that?

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:29.770
Why should I?

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:34.150
As a father, recording my daughter's growth is the proper thing to do.

00:10:34.150 --> 00:10:36.490
That is definitely not "proper"!

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:40.780
Can't we have a normal father-and-daughter relationship?

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:45.790
I want to be a normal girl, Otou-sama.

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:52.290
Did someone tell you something?

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:54.090
No.

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:55.800
Someone did tell you something...

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:59.130
If anyone heard about this, they would find it weird.

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:02.890
Rea, you don't understand.

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:05.100
You do not understand the situation.

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:12.600
There is only one thing that is right in this world: my love for you.

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:31.540
I had a feeling something bad would happen.

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:34.460
Transferred?!

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:37.300
She transferred suddenly due to some circumstances with her father.

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:40.550
It seems he was forced to quit his job.

00:11:46.310 --> 00:11:47.720
Once again...

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:50.060
Once again, he has forced people away from me...

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:05.070
Thank God!

00:12:05.070 --> 00:12:07.450
I thought I would not see you again.

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:11.960
It seems the place that my family is moving to does not allow pets.

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:14.210
Therefore, I am going to the veterinary centre.

00:12:14.210 --> 00:12:15.920
I have say good bye to him.

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:21.170
Both my father and mother have become strange.

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:23.300
Being accused of things we have no memory of doing...

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:24.430
This...

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:27.470
My relatives told me.

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:31.060
What did you tell your father?!

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:33.230
Have I ever done anything bad to you?!

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:35.980
No way, I...

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:42.990
I shouldn't have been friendly with you in the first place.

00:12:47.070 --> 00:12:50.620
He will snatch everything away from me.

00:12:54.410 --> 00:12:57.130
You still don't understand anything.

00:12:57.130 --> 00:13:00.840
The idea of happiness varies from person to person.

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:04.170
The pureness of my love for you...

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:06.260
...is not something normal people would understand.

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:10.260
I do not want to understand something like that.

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:14.560
One day you will understand... the depth of my love.

00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:19.020
My love is a unique form in this world.

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:25.280
Rea, if you don't comprehend this,

00:13:25.280 --> 00:13:28.370
it will only cause misfortune to others.

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:36.330
What an extravagant daughter...

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:39.290
Your life is far more luxurious than anyone else's.

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:41.800
How can you not realize that?

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:50.260
Rea, take off your clothes.

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:57.020
If my happiness leads to the misfortune of others,

00:13:57.640 --> 00:14:00.520
Happy birthday, Rea.

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:05.530
it would be much better for me to stay miserable.

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:11.990
Well then, let's use what I just picked and make the potion.

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:13.990
But this is...

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:16.000
Yes, it is a hortensia.

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:18.420
Hey, hey, are you saying that the normal hortensia,

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:20.830
which can be found all over the street, is poisonous?!

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:21.880
Yes.

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:24.630
Although I do not know much about it,

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:27.420
my family crest is actually a hortensia,

00:14:27.420 --> 00:14:29.760
and lot of them are planted in my garden.

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:33.600
Therefore, when I was small,

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:36.890
Father warned me not to put any of them into my mouth.

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:38.020
But...

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:41.060
...at home, when he is in a daze,

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:43.360
my grandpa sometimes bites the hortensia leaves.

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:45.110
Eh?!

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:47.900
Does the effect vary depending on the person?

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:55.330
A-Anyway, let us try using this today.

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:57.620
So let's do it!

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:13.640
Finished.

00:15:14.550 --> 00:15:16.390
Hold this for a minute.

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:17.680
I'll take Babu out.

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:30.820
Babu... Come back to life.

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:36.200
Pass me the medicine.

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:37.120
Here.

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:44.130
Babu-chan, today, you'll definitely...

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:10.740
What a shame.

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:13.700
But surely it'll be fine.

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:17.910
We can try another kind of poisonous herb tomorrow.

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:20.700
No. Let's stop already.

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:26.460
If this goes on, I'm going to feel really sorry for Babu.

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:28.960
I'm only being selfish.

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:31.920
I'm sorry, Babu.

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:33.470
I'm going to bury you.

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:37.970
I see...

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:40.270
It's already late.

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:42.890
Let's bury him together tomorrow.

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:45.230
Thanks for helping me up until now.

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:46.730
You've been really helpful.

00:16:46.730 --> 00:16:48.360
I see.

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:53.240
Then, from now on, I will not be able to meet you here again.

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:53.990
Huh?

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:55.570
Nothing!

00:16:55.570 --> 00:16:57.950
Let's go home!

00:16:57.950 --> 00:17:00.240
Well then, see you tomorrow.

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:03.000
Hey, you...

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:06.830
Aren't you dragging your foot a bit?

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:12.880
I twisted it earlier when my foot slipped.

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:15.050
But it will be fine,

00:17:15.050 --> 00:17:16.260
going back to my house...

00:17:18.090 --> 00:17:18.640
Honestly...

00:17:22.270 --> 00:17:22.850
Hey!

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:24.770
What are you doing?

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:25.810
No~!

00:17:25.810 --> 00:17:27.060
Where are you touching?!

00:17:36.280 --> 00:17:40.280
Why did I have to be born into this family?

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:45.290
Why was I not born into a normal family like everyone else?

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:47.670
Obviously, I want to live on.

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:52.420
I want to smile from the bottom of my heart, like everyone else.

00:17:55.630 --> 00:17:58.550
Welcome home, Ojou-sama.

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:00.510
I'm home.

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:02.930
That's why I want to be reborn.

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:06.140
After I am reborn, I will be free.

00:18:11.440 --> 00:18:14.230
If I cannot do that, I would rather...

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:19.700
Can I leave you here?

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:21.200
Yes.

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:24.950
Your house is the mansion on top of the hill, right?

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:26.790
I can take you further up...

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:28.460
No, it's fine.

00:18:28.460 --> 00:18:31.790
I am not going to use the main entrance since I sneaked out.

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:36.010
I always use the hidden path at those bushes to come and go.

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:37.720
Ah, I see.

00:18:37.720 --> 00:18:41.930
It's good that my father does not know about this yet.

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:44.720
I really am reckless.

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:48.230
Hey, you really are afraid of your father.

00:18:48.230 --> 00:18:50.730
I'll give Babu-chan back to you.

00:18:57.990 --> 00:18:59.610
See you.

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:00.410
Yeah.

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:07.750
Don't be late for Babu's funeral tomorrow!

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:10.750
Of course I won't!

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:13.920
See you.

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:27.310
How can this be...

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:37.820
Rea!

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:56.460
Welcome home...

00:19:56.460 --> 00:19:58.760
Eh? Ranko!

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:00.670
Why are you in my house?

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:03.090
I came to return some DVDs.

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:06.220
Don't randomly use other people's bathroom.

00:20:06.220 --> 00:20:08.930
It's fine! We're cousins after all.

00:20:10.430 --> 00:20:16.650
So, you'd better spit out where you've been this late at night.

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:20.030
Oh crap! Surprise attack!

00:20:20.030 --> 00:20:22.450
Today I randomly went to the convenience store and bought some ice cream.

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:24.320
Then I laid down next to the river...

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:27.030
Eh? How suspicious.

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:28.700
Your sister said that you've been going out every night,

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:33.920
ever since the day that Babu-chan died.

00:20:35.330 --> 00:20:37.540
And what's more, you're carrying a box like that...

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:41.210
That... I want to use that to have some adventure on the river...

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:44.630
Hey, what do you have inside it?

00:20:44.630 --> 00:20:46.050
Hey! Don't open-

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:48.970
Perhaps your zombie hobby has got worse,

00:20:48.970 --> 00:20:50.970
and you've been doing terrible things to Babu-chan's body?

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:52.480
Wait!

00:21:00.730 --> 00:21:03.740
Hey! Just now, wasn't that...

00:21:04.030 --> 00:21:06.990
I-It worked!

00:21:13.830 --> 00:21:18.210
I'm sorry, Furuya-kun, Babu-chan.

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:20.300
I cannot come tomorrow.

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:24.170
I will never be allowed to leave this house again,

00:21:24.920 --> 00:21:27.680
not even to go to school.

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:30.760
My father is definitely serious about that.

00:21:32.770 --> 00:21:34.310
I am sorry.

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:38.770
I took a little bit of that medicine.

00:21:40.570 --> 00:21:43.610
Even if it does not have the power of resurrection,

00:21:43.610 --> 00:21:46.820
it does contain the extract of a poisonous herb.

00:21:47.530 --> 00:21:49.530
The opposite effect will be...

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:03.300
I decided I would rather die.

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:45.060
Hey, stop this already!

00:23:46.110 --> 00:23:48.570
I thought it wouldn't have any effect.

00:23:49.320 --> 00:23:51.950
Eh? Favourable reputation?

00:23:51.950 --> 00:23:54.070
How can that be?

00:23:57.620 --> 00:23:59.450
Next time: Sankarea.

00:23:59.450 --> 00:24:02.670
Episode 3: "Sanka... Rea."

00:24:02.670 --> 00:24:04.130
You better watch it, Mer!

00:24:04.830 --> 00:24:07.660
For now, can I meet the person who wrote the script?

00:24:07.660 --> 00:24:09.760
I have quite a few things to say to him.
